# Allow-list: nothing goes into an image unless named below. Private data (profile/, data/,
# .env, .scout/, logs) must never be baked into an image; pods get them from volumes and a Secret.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!api/src/
!api/config/
!api/templates/
!requierements/*.md
!queue/
!jd-search/
!gateway/
!ui/
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*_test.go
**/.DS_Store
